  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cod fish pieces and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the fish stock and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 10 minutes or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Serve the fish and sauce over a bed of vegetables or cauliflower rice."
